After ascending a Valkyrie and a Barbarian (I know, no big deal), I got a
Caveman who despite losing TWO suits of grey dragon scale mail to sinks
(one from a wish and another from a grey dragon) still managed to make it 
all the way down to the 26th level of Gehennom before choking on a tin of
troll meat.  What was really annoying was that I had an amulet of magical
breathing and an amulet of life saving in my inventory but I was wearing the
amulet of ESP at the time.  I did notice he left a bones file, though...
so I decided to play just "one" more game before heading off to work.  
Fired up a wizard who started with a wand of polymorph, potions of confusion,
sickness, and blindness(so the only bad potion out would be hallucination),
and a magic marker.  Needless to say, after one zap the potions had turned
into something a lot more useful(healing and extra healing) and I was the
proud owner of a yellow dragon.  Thanks to him, I looted every shop in the game
and polypiled up gauntlets of power and speed boots.  He got morphed into a
black dragon by a polymorph trap, but then perished to Medusa.  Soon, I was
redescending into the depths of Gehennom...with my 3 magic markers the mazes
were a piece of cake.  Then, after finding the vibrating square within 20 
moves, I go back up to the wiz's tower wielding magicbane and find a cockatrice
corpse from his zoo.  Hmm, I think, stoning the wiz would certainly be a good
idea.  So I lure him out and stone him, and make a run for the ladder...
you fall down the ladder...
the corpse touches you...
you turn to stone....

ARGH!!  2 gehennom bones files in 2 days(yes, I spent the whole day
working on that wizard)!  Am I cursed?

